  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation of the prioritized HIV prevention services among key populations in Bangladesh - Bangladesh (01-Dec-2015-30-Nov-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh, HIV, Save the Children Federation, Inc. (STC HQ)This program has the following goals: To reduce HIV transmission among key populations in Bangladesh. The objectives of this program are: Continuing HIV prevention services for key populations at higher risk - this includes FSWs in streets, hotels and residences, male and female PWID.  Continuing required Care, Treatment and Support activities - for PLHIV in order to ensure delivery and adherence to ART</narrative>
  </description>
